%% Source of truth for the "How it works" diagram on the guide page.
%% Rendered to web/howitworks.svg by `make diagram` — mermaid never ships to the
%% browser (it is ~800KB gzipped, and this diagram never changes at runtime).
%%
%% Two constraints, both from the phone:
%%   - keep it SHALLOW. Every rank is ~90px, and a diagram taller than the viewport
%%     pushes the spotlit node off screen while you read the step explaining it.
%%   - keep labels SHORT and lowercase-distinct: the walkthrough spotlights nodes by
%%     matching its `focus` strings against node text.
%% The init directive tightens mermaid's default spacing, which is tuned for desktop.
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"nodeSpacing": 20, "rankSpacing": 30, "padding": 6, "useMaxWidth": true}}}%%
graph TD
  Files[".md / .txt files"] --> Ingest["ingest"]
  Ingest --> Store[("SQLite — text + vectors")]
  Question["your question"] --> Search["hybrid search"]
  Store --> Search
  Search --> Matches["top matches"]
  Matches --> Answer["grounded answer, cites [1]"]
